 "titulo": "ANDERSEN-ANDERSEN",
 "fila": null,
 "contenido": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj0tdBr7WC47g0JiyolAIAdr0ejPYgKWBh6H-ra7Iq1b5kEzVrol007i3EP1SkYsN0mr3MyLMsxALTMtq6bzb2tMes9bMRawyT0Lr6IF3t1l9wOn3E5XouI288m7yT5YhfKwdnqwfoKwNO2QcJeuNSZEJ5UslJWJ2g1piHY1oj-HrkvPl1dkco7LQHAHqU/s2048/Lyserod.webp\" style=\"display: block; padding: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1151\" data-original-width=\"2048\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj0tdBr7WC47g0JiyolAIAdr0ejPYgKWBh6H-ra7Iq1b5kEzVrol007i3EP1SkYsN0mr3MyLMsxALTMtq6bzb2tMes9bMRawyT0Lr6IF3t1l9wOn3E5XouI288m7yT5YhfKwdnqwfoKwNO2QcJeuNSZEJ5UslJWJ2g1piHY1oj-HrkvPl1dkco7LQHAHqU/s320/Lyserod.webp\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>Andersen-Andersen es una firma danesa de knitwear premium fundada en 2009, reconocida por reinterpretar el clásico jersey marinero escandinavo con un enfoque minimalista y duradero. Sus prendas combinan tradición marítima, funcionalidad y diseño atemporal.<div id=\"tienda-catalogo\"></div>\n\n<div id=\"sentinel\" style=\"height: 1px;\"></div>\n\n<div id=\"loader\" style=\"display: none; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">\n  Cargando...\n</div>\n\n<style>\n#tienda-catalogo{\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(200px,1fr));\n  gap:20px;\n  font-family:Arial;\n}\n\n.producto-card{\n  border:1px solid #eaeaea;\n  padding:15px;\n  border-radius:10px;\n  text-align:center;\n  background:#fff;\n}\n\n.producto-card img{\n  width:100%;\n  height:200px;\n  object-fit:cover;\n  border-radius:8px;\n}\n\n.producto-title{\n  font-size:14px;\n  margin:10px 0;\n  font-weight:600;\n}\n\n.producto-link{\n  display:block;\n  background:#111;\n  color:#fff;\n  padding:10px;\n  text-decoration:none;\n  border-radius:6px;\n  font-size:12px;\n  font-weight:bold;\n}\n</style>\n\n<script>\n\nvar TIENDA_URL = \"https://andersen-andersen.com\";\n\nvar APPS_SCRIPT = \"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwAz-q8cQuhZsdVzfl5bY9my_rzawc1B3lW4b8fAc1jtUgC9ZQcC-lg2iGHp5bq4KM6YQ/exec\";\n\nvar paginaActual = 1;\nvar cargando = false;\nvar hayMas = true;\nvar cola = false;\n\nfunction limpiarUrl(url){\n  return url ? url.replace(/&amp;/g,\"&\").replace(/&apos;/g,\"'\") : \"\";\n}\n\nfunction crearTarjeta(p){\n  return `\n    <div class=\"producto-card\">\n      <img src=\"${limpiarUrl(p.imagen)}\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"producto-title\">${p.titulo}</div>\n      <a class=\"producto-link\"\n         href=\"${limpiarUrl(p.url)}\"\n         target=\"_blank\"\n         onclick=\"registrarClic('${p.titulo.replace(/'/g,\"\\\\'\")}','${p.url}','${p.tienda}')\">\n        Comprar\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  `;\n}\n\nasync function cargarProductos(){\n\n  if(cargando || !hayMas) return;\n\n  cargando = true;\n\n  document.getElementById(\"loader\").style.display = \"block\";\n\n  try {\n\n    var res = await fetch(\n      APPS_SCRIPT +\n      \"?tienda=\" + encodeURIComponent(TIENDA_URL) +\n      \"&pagina=\" + paginaActual\n    );\n\n    var data = await res.json();\n\n    var cont = document.getElementById(\"tienda-catalogo\");\n\n    cont.innerHTML += data.productos.map(crearTarjeta).join(\"\");\n\n    hayMas = data.hayMas;\n\n    paginaActual++;\n\n  } catch(e){\n    console.log(e);\n  }\n\n  document.getElementById(\"loader\").style.display = \"none\";\n\n  cargando = false;\n\n  if(cola){\n    cola = false;\n    cargarProductos();\n  }\n}\n\n// 🔥 INFINITE SCROLL\ndocument.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function(){\n\n  cargarProductos();\n\n  var sentinel = document.getElementById(\"sentinel\");\n\n  var observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n\n    if(entries[0].isIntersecting){\n\n      if(cargando){\n        cola = true;\n        return;\n      }\n\n      cargarProductos();\n    }\n\n  }, { rootMargin: \"250px\" });\n\n  observer.observe(sentinel);\n\n});\n\n// 🔥 TRACKING CORREGIDO (IMPORTANTE)\nasync function registrarClic(titulo, url, tienda){\n\n  try {\n\n    await fetch(APPS_SCRIPT, {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n      },\n      body: JSON.stringify({\n        tienda: tienda,\n        titulo: titulo,\n        url: url\n      }),\n      mode: \"no-cors\"\n    });\n\n  } catch(e){\n    console.log(\"tracking error\", e);\n  }\n}\n\n</script><div><br /></div><a href=\"https://andersen-andersen.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>IR A LA WEB OFICIAL&nbsp;</b></a><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: xx-large;\">SI ESTÁ AGOTADA TU TALLA, COLOR&nbsp; O NO ENVÍAN A TU DESTINO CONTÁCTANOS:&nbsp;</span><a href=\"mailto:comercialyventas@gmail.com\" style=\"font-size: xx-large;\">comercialyventas@gmail.com</a></div>",
 "fecha_copia": "2026-09-26T17:00:53.894Z"
}